# Cloudflare Pages headers. Since the launch (F6, 2026-11-22) only the landing page is indexed; the app pages,
# the developer tools and the game screenshots' folder stay out of search (robots.txt says the same).
# Hub security audit 2026-11-22, K-6: other sites cannot put these pages in a frame (clickjacking).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'

/teacher*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/play*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/*.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/*.css
  Cache-Control: no-cache
